{
  "name": "canvas-lab",
  "version": "0.1.11",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "公司图像模型的本地运营与测试工作台",
  "releaseNotes": [
    "三个工作台新增 GitHub 正式版本检测和用户确认后的自动安装；Release 运行包支持原地更新与失败回滚，源码工作区安装到新目录，保留配置与本地数据。",
    "新增 ComfyUI 与 GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst 双引擎 AI 扩图，支持拖动画布调整原图位置与四边留白。",
    "效果图美化提供独立 Prompt、低/高强度和自然/暖/冷色调六种组合，与效果图氛围转换分别配置。",
    "Beta 跑图按飞书样本 ID 按需取图，支持全景图美化、逐样本空房类型与提示词模型权限准入。",
    "自动安装校验官方 SHA-256，原地更新前检查任务空闲、更新后提示重启；完善错误与完成反馈，升级 sharp 至 0.35.5。"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "benchmark": "node --env-file-if-exists=.env.local benchmark-runner.mjs",
    "benchmark:backfill": "node --env-file-if-exists=.env.local benchmark-backfill.mjs",
    "lark:init": "lark-cli config init --new",
    "lark:status": "lark-cli auth status --json --verify",
    "release:check": "node scripts/release-check.mjs",
    "release:pack": "node scripts/release-pack.mjs",
    "release:publish": "node scripts/release-publish.mjs",
    "start": "node --env-file-if-exists=.env.local server.mjs",
    "test": "node --test"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@fontsource-variable/inter": "5.3.0",
    "@larksuite/cli": "1.0.77",
    "pannellum": "2.5.7",
    "sharp": "0.35.5"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24"
  },
  "allowScripts": {
    "@larksuite/cli@1.0.77": true
  }
}
